{"2702570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Konkwest", "steam_appid": 2702570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "In Konkwest your world domination campaign takes a single session. Take control of a country, and shape its history turn by turn. Plan its developments, its conquests, and its defenses. Make your plans simultaneously with all other countries and see them change the world.<br><br><strong>Simultaneous Turns around the World</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Get rid of your flat map game, and accept the curve in Konkwest's globe view<br></li><li> Reject sequentialism, embrace simultaneous planning, don’t wait endlessly for your turn</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702570/extras/c823dfd771864aa7592efabcfb83f728.webp?t=1775482188\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 2024 - Play (almost) any state in our modern world, even unrecognized ones<br></li><li> 2000 - That's over 20 years ago already, isn't that crazy?<br></li><li> 1900 - The buildup to WW1 belongs in any historical strategy map game<br></li><li> 1700 - Big Poland, big Sweden, big Ottoman Empire, what’s not to love<br></li><li> 1300 - Experience the Holy Roman Empire at its height in a Medieval World<br></li><li> 0 (1BC) - Challenge the great ancient empires of Rome and China, or lead them to world domination<br></li><li> Balanced - A custom scenario where the world is divided up between equally sized countries<br></li><li> Kaiserzeit 1926 - A unique alternate history created for an unknown board game</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702570/extras/d50d64aefb55e15c75a542176b1eaa16.webp?t=1775482188\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Create your own country in any place, and give it a unique 