<br></li><li> Kaiserzeit 1926 - A unique alternate history created for an unknown board game</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702570/extras/d50d64aefb55e15c75a542176b1eaa16.webp?t=1775482188\" width=616 height=48 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Create your own country in any place, and give it a unique identity<br></li><li> Change its name, its color, and its policies to your liking<br></li><li> Add other countries to your world, and see them expand or fail</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702570/extras/77828ad589131e3d66cd1af7ff46642b.webp?t=1775482188\" width=616 height=49 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play with many other players in a single session <br></li><li> Connect with friends and others through the game's community</li></ul>", "short_description": "The arcade grand strategy game. In Konkwest you and your friends can play through a world conquest campaign in an evening. Many historical starting scenarios bring you into the game world and let you lead your empire to glory. The single-resource economy makes the game accessible to all.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Arabic, Dutch, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America", "reviews": "“Konkwest’s simultaneous turn system immediately stood out as a refreshing way to keep the game flowing. This design choice makes multiplayer feel faster paced and more engaging, which I really appreciated.  The historical scenarios are another strong point here.”<br>7.5 – The Drastik Measure<br><br>“Strategy that seems simple, but incorporates great possibilities and hours of play [...] The game feels truly integrated and complete.”<br>7 – Somos Gaming<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702570/header.jpg?t=1775482188", "capsule_image": "